10)------------HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(s_store_sk@0, ss_store_sk@3)], projection=[ss_sold_date_sk@1, ss_cdemo_sk@2, ss_addr_sk@3, ss_quantity@5, ss_sales_price@6, ss_net_profit@7]
